Experimental hierarchical-search reference tests

tests/hierarchical.rkt adapts the stream merge/bind rules of microKanren
and the once/ifte rules of TRS2 as an independent test oracle, following
the Typed Racket rewrites in https://github.com/NoahStoryM/miniKanren-typed.
The oracle removes types and interprets a small generated expression
language instead of substitutions. The tests do not reproduce book prose.

Sources:
https://github.com/jasonhemann/microKanren (microKanren.scm)
https://github.com/TheReasonedSchemer2ndEd/CodeFromTheReasonedSchemer2ndEd
(trs2-impl.scm)

The private hierarchical driver expresses these scheduling rules using
explicit events and amb's captured continuations, with lazy mature tails.

